{"suttaId":"tha-ap426","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[192,212],"vripara":"61"},"segments":{"tha-ap426:0.3":"Sattakadambapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap426:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, kukkuṭo [kadambo (sī. syā. pī.)] nāma pabbato;","tha-ap426:1.3":"Tamhi pabbatapādamhi, satta buddhā vasiṃsu te.","tha-ap426:2.1":"“Kadambaṃ pupphitaṃ disvā, paggahetvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap426:2.3":"Satta mālā gahetvāna, puññacittena [puṇṇacittena (ka.)] okiriṃ.","tha-ap426:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap426:3.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap426:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap426:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap426:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap426:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap426:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap426:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sattakadambapupphiyo thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap426:9.1":"Sattakadambapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
